(This contract implements a bill payment system with quantum-safe considerations on QoreChain. It includes proper) Tj
T* (reentrancy protection, access controls, and handles fund deposits/withdrawals. However, there are concerns) Tj
T* (regarding the implementation of quantum-safe signatures within the contract itself, potential reentrancy risks due to) Tj
T* (external calls, and lack of fallback handling for PQC algorithms. The contract also has minor logic gaps in payee) Tj
T* (validation and event emission.) Tj
